Q: Minimal Api byte[] parameter binding problem A: <p>It's possible to read directly from the request body</p>
<pre><code>app.MapGet(&quot;api/srv/myget&quot;, async (HttpRequest request) =&gt;
{
    using var ms = new MemoryStream();
    await request.Body.CopyToAsync(ms);
    var data= ms.ToArray();

    DoSomethingWith(data);

    return Results.Ok();
});
</code></pre>
<p>If possible you could send the data as a base64 string as in this example. Then the client sends json of course</p>
<pre><code>app.MapPost(&quot;/addtextfrombase64&quot;, (AddTextFromBase64 p, [FromServices] Server server) =&gt;
    server.AddTextFromBase64(p.pdf64)).WithName(&quot;addtextfrombase64&quot;).WithOpenApi();
</code></pre>
