Q: Insert a newline after a function block A: <p>VS Code's formatter itself doesn't control rules like this. That kind of formatting logic typically comes from ESLint.<br />
You can add this rule to your ESLint config to achieve the intended behavior:</p>
<pre class="lang-json prettyprint-override"><code>{
  &quot;rules&quot;: {
    &quot;padding-line-between-statements&quot;: [
      &quot;error&quot;,
      {
        &quot;blankLine&quot;: &quot;always&quot;,
        &quot;prev&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,
        &quot;next&quot;: &quot;function&quot;
      }
    ]
  }
}
</code></pre>
